  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/11/IMG_2552.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El antiguo colegio Monteblanco de Onda ha acogido este fin de semana el VI concurso de canarios de canto timbrado espa&ntilde;ol, en&nbsp;con participantes&nbsp;de toda la Comunitat Valenciana e incluso de Zaragoza, juzgados por el juez c&aacute;ntabro Santiago Vega.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscanttimbratonda17113/img_2517.jpg\" alt=\"img_2517\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscanttimbratonda17113/img_2518.jpg\" alt=\"img_2518\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscanttimbratonda17113/img_2519.jpg\" alt=\"img_2519\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscanttimbratonda17113/img_2520.jpg\" alt=\"img_2520\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscanttimbratonda17113/img_2521.jpg\" alt=\"img_2521\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscanttimbratonda17113/img_2522.jpg\" alt=\"img_2522\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscanttimbratonda17113/img_2523.jpg\" alt=\"img_2523\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscanttimbratonda17113/img_2524.jpg\" alt=\"img_2524\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscanttimbratonda17113/img_2525.jpg\" alt=\"img_2525\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"